  "content": "\n\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3cdrsl5X/5f0b2ecf93df1b5001c9b9d0ddb95f01a57596f2_96.webp\" alt=\"Euphoria_Patches_logo\" width=\"40\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; 基於 Complementary Shaders 的修改版</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6eca16d9dd4b1b8c64f68a3f82e524a63e121d07.png\" alt=\"Comparison\"></p>\n<div>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DISCORD - white?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=lightblue&label=JOIN&labelColor=white&color=lightblue\">\n</a>\n\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/iris, oculus, optifine | 1.8.3 to latest - white?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=lightblue&label=supports&labelColor=white&color=lightblue\">\n\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17 - white?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=lightblue&label=support&labelColor=white&color=lightblue\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>PixelCraft Shaders 是一款 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a> 修改版，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fSpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SpacEagle17</a> 開發，旨在重現像素藝術風格。每一張截圖都是賦予生命的全新藝術作品！</p>\n<p><strong>重要提示：請不要將任何錯誤回報給 Emin，聯絡資訊如下。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3979faef6c57848624dcf2a0178b51c96855cd2e.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n<br>\n</a></p>\n<h2>🔗 連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上支持 SpacEagle17，即可取得預覽版本！</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a></strong> - SpacEagle17 的主要專案 Euphoria Patches！</li>\n<li>聯絡方式：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://euphoriapatches.com/contact</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>贊助單位：Ember Host</h2>\n<p>正在尋找價格實惠且可靠的 Minecraft 伺服器主機？來看看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ember Host</strong></a>！我個人非常喜歡與他們合作——他們的性價比極高，評價被嚴重低估，並且擁有超棒的客服團隊。</p>\n<p>點擊下方橫幅，您將在首次購買時獲得 <strong>10% 折扣</strong>，同時支持 Euphoria Patches 的開發，首筆購買金額的 50% 將直接捐贈給創作者。或者，您可以在結帳時使用代碼 <strong>EUPHORIA</strong> 來領取折扣！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/assets/img/other/ember_host_ep.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a> 的開發者 Emin 以及所有 Discord 上的測試員！沒有你們，這個專案將無法完成！</p>",
